    "long_instructions": "For a media studies project, you’ve been asked to find out if songs are getting longer or shorter over time. You have a file with the average length of a hit song (in seconds) from each decade since 1940.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Import the `csv` module.\r\n2. Call the `open` function to open the `music.csv` file.\r\n3. Read the file with `csv.DictReader`.\r\n4. Loop through the data. The `decade` value is already printed for you. Add a line to print the `length` value too. Compare your printed output to the CSV file. Do the numbers match?\r\n5. Close the file.\r\n",
